{"duration_api_ms":234268,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0204548c-a824-57b7-bea3-1783011bc81a","total_cost_usd":1.5481980000000002,"usage":{"input_tokens":48,"cache_creation_input_tokens":80813,"cache_read_input_tokens":1865297,"output_tokens":26405,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":5767},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":80813,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1386,"cache_read_input_tokens":111291,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1776,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1776},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":48,"outputTokens":26405,"cacheReadInputTokens":1865297,"cacheCreationInputTokens":80813,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.5478554000000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":5767,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":80813,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1796,"outputTokens":326,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.00034260000000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":302,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":24,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I've measured the document editor's open on the native package and added the split to `baseline.md`. In short: the ~1.4 s before the document is requested goes almost entirely to building the web-apps interface; sdkjs barely appears in it. The packet has no acceptance commands, so there was nothing to run. `theseus validate` reports 0 errors and 1 warning, which I didn't look into.\n\n**What I measured.** Both PKT-0016 docx samples (10 and 100 pages), 5 opens each in a fresh browser, with a timing marker on `asc_LoadDocument`. Each profiled open is paired with an unprofiled one, so the timings aren't skewed by the profiler. The new script is `.theseus/oracle/perf/open-window.js` and the raw data is in `perf/open-window-2026-11-02.json`.\n\n**Findings:**\n- **Timeline (median):** `asc_LoadDocument` is called at about 1.42 s, Editor.bin is requested 65–100 ms later, and the document is fully loaded at 3.8–4.4 s.\n- **CPU before `asc_LoadDocument`:** about 1.1 s of the 1.4 s is busy.\n  - About 0.95 s is web-apps: the documenteditor app code (~0.18 s), apps/common (~0.13–0.17 s), jQuery called by the UI build (~0.4 s) and script/style parsing (~0.2 s).\n  - sdkjs costs only ~80 ms here (`sdk-all-min.js`).\n- **The word engine is off this path.** `sdk-all.js` (18 MB uncompressed) downloads in parallel and finishes after Editor.bin is requested, so it costs nothing in this window.\n- **Controllers:** their `onLaunch` hooks are cheap. The real cost is the UI build that runs after the permissions message (`Main.onEditorPermissions → Toolbar.onAppShowed`).\n  - Toolbar ≈ 250 ms of its own CPU, ≈ 0.5 s including the code it calls.\n  - Comments ≈ 100 ms, Main ≈ 80–100 ms, Viewport ≈ 70 ms; the other controllers are small.\n- **Locale and CSS** don't show up as separate scripts: their cost is part of the browser's own parsing time.\n- **Sizes:** I could only get uncompressed sizes; the browser doesn't report compressed transfer sizes on this setup. So the \"~500 KB of scripts\" figure from PKT-0016 is an undercount: the scripts are about 23 MB uncompressed.\n- **Is a refactor worth it?** Lazy-loading the ~30 controllers as code would save under 0.1 s. Deferring hidden toolbar tabs and the Comments launch might save 0.3–0.4 s. That figure is my estimate, not measured. The 2.3–2.9 s after Editor.bin arrives is the bigger target either way.\n\n**Decisions:**\n- I sampled the CPU every 1 ms rather than every 0.1 ms, because the finer rate roughly doubled the open time in a trial run.\n- The documenteditor app and apps/common ship as one bundle (`app.js`), so I split it module by module (`DE.*`, `Common.*`, everything else counted as vendor).\n- I report controller cost two ways: inside `onLaunch` only, and all work under each controller.\n\n**Not done:** only docx was in scope, and compressed sizes weren't measured. The samples came from another worktree's scratch folder because they aren't committed anywhere; I noted that in the friction line and didn't request a packet for it.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas** (also in the packet):\n- Before Editor.bin, the documenteditor's open time is the web-apps UI build, not sdkjs.\n- `app.js` contains apps/common, so split it per module, not per URL.\n- The browser reports no usable compressed sizes on this stack.\n\nEverything is committed as `fcb7ded` on the packet branch, including the Executor log and friction line.","ttft_ms":1887,"type":"result","duration_ms":518785,"uuid":"af342e25-fd66-487f-9181-9968342ad90c","ttft_stream_ms":977,"time_to_request_ms":381,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":8,"system_prompt":206,"resume_other":1,"process_user_input":4,"input_attachments":27,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":8,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":9,"init_frame_send":7,"engine_pickup":10,"loop_entry":4,"message_prep":2,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":3,"requ